# A premise the agent asserts about the CALL'S OWN NAME.  call_name is injected
# by the evaluator AFTER premise verification, so this is premise-false — an
# agent cannot certify its own identity.  (If the two ever swapped order, this
# arm is what would catch it.)
CallA is named Writeverb.
CallA is grounded in a verb W1 if CallA is named W1.
CallA contends for a verb W1 if CallA is grounded in W1.
